Upstream-bound: yes
Subject: [match-neutral] pointer-safe freeFilesFrom / archive entry

freeFilesFrom takes a void* threshold (not a raw PS1 u32 address);
archive entry lookups use pointer + offset instead of pointer↔s32
casts (ROADMAP P2.4 / SURVEY).

